# API

Wire deps, call use-case. See [application](./application.mdc).

## Do

- Export async functions named like contract procedures (`signUp`)
- `new UseCase(new AuthService(), new UserAdapter())` then `execute`
- Shared dto types

## Don't

- Business logic, Drizzle, oRPC/contracts

```ts
export async function signUp(input: CreateUserInputDtoType): Promise<CreateUserOutputDtoType> {
  const useCase = new SignUpUseCase(new AuthService(), new UserAdapter());
  return await useCase.execute(input);
}
```
